    Expert Skills Accredited
    100% Online
    2 Months Access
    Beginner Friendly

  Clinical Medical Technician & EKG/ECG Courses
  Get two of healthcare's most in-demand certifications in a single deal. Build a broad clinical foundation with the CMT course or gain deep cardiac monitoring expertise with the specialized EKG/ECG Course.

    A natural learning progression. Both courses share overlapping EKG and phlebotomy content. Purchase either course individually, or save significantly with the 2-course bundle to master the full range of hands-on patient care, administrative duties, and advanced arrhythmia recognition.

  The Course Options







      Option 1 — Clinical Medical Technician Course
      12 modules covering vital signs, ECG/EKG, phlebotomy, EHR navigation, OSHA/HIPAA compliance, plus resume and interview prep.







      Option 2 — EKG/ECG Course
      Comprehensive curriculum covering 12-lead placement, arrhythmia recognition, waveform morphology, MI identification, and real EKG strips.


      BEST VALUE





      Option 3 — CMT & EKG Bundle
      Both certifications included! Save $60 versus buying separately and gain a full cardiac and clinical skill set with 2 months access per course.


  What You'll Learn




        Clinical & Phlebotomy Excellence — Master vital signs measurement, blood collection techniques, site selection, and proper specimen handling.



        Advanced EKG Analysis — Learn standard 12-lead placement, waveform morphology, complex arrhythmia detection, and MI/ischemia recognition using real-world EKG strips.



        Admin & Safety Compliance — Navigate Electronic Health Records (EHR) and ensure strict compliance with OSHA standards and HIPAA privacy protocols.



        Career Readiness — Gain an edge with dedicated modules on resume building, interview preparation, and navigating real-world clinical scenarios.



  Key Facts at a Glance


      FORMAT
      100% online and self-paced. CMT includes 12 modules; EKG includes real strip diagrams.


      ACCESS
      2 Months of unlimited access per course from enrollment (Extensions available)


      CERT
      Digital Certificate of Completion issued immediately upon passing


      ACCRED
      Both courses are accredited by Expert Skills. EKG course may qualify for CE credits.


  Important — Prerequisites & Requirements


      PREREQ
      No prior medical experience required! Both courses are designed for complete beginners. Note: Some employers or states may require hands-on clinical hours or in-person practicums in addition to theoretical certification. Always verify local requirements.


  Career Opportunities





      Clinical Medical Techs — Ideal for those seeking roles in hospitals, clinics, urgent care centers, and diagnostic labs.





      EKG & Telemetry Techs — Perfect for securing roles in hospitals, cardiac monitoring units, and as EMTs.





      Career Changers — Complete beginners entering the healthcare field wanting to stand out with dual certifications.


  Access & Upgrades

    Desktop/Laptop Recommended
    Stable Internet Required
    Redeem via My Stuff
    Optional Hard-Copy Diploma Available






